  "description": "From the high seas to high society.\n\nWhen the infamous pirate Rosetta gets poisoned to death, she wakes up in the body of noble lady Leah. Now, to avoid a second death, Rosetta must play the part of a noble and... get engaged?! But to whom? Could it be to the strange admiral who has suddenly come chasing after \"Rosetta\"?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
